{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/heb",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/heb.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32b.2",
      "source_sha256": "3684b0f9f2890c04",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. not through many persons, but through the Son of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32b.3",
      "source_sha256": "f0bc62b6cb12c8c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the form of substance is the same with them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32b.4",
      "source_sha256": "a34b1f813ee6f08c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. through the passion of his body, as he is its splendour and its figure [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32b.5",
      "source_sha256": "31177304f53ba090",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "than the angels who ministered the Old Law."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32b.6",
      "source_sha256": "94eba067892a8bd2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a true son by nature, not by choice [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32b.7",
      "source_sha256": "2c2559a78c4f9e44",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. on the day on which his Godhead was revealed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.1",
      "source_sha256": "36d5dfd5ecbf3459",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. whether to the Godhead or to the humanity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.2",
      "source_sha256": "60d09827b304b804",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the angels, then, are his."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.3",
      "source_sha256": "ce2a34d6ae7bd876",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to minister salvation to everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.4",
      "source_sha256": "1a0b7031081ea3ee",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. to bring vengeance upon sinners."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.5",
      "source_sha256": "a47c2817b1c4d711",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. not like what was said before."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.6",
      "source_sha256": "98ae645478abf81b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in elements."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.7",
      "source_sha256": "5b040bce5a38dc2c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that is not like the works of an angel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.8",
      "source_sha256": "fb92c9684d4557f0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that was not said to any of the angels."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.9",
      "source_sha256": "227ec532be0ffa3c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "form and appearance, not substance."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.10",
      "source_sha256": "3563da85ca306d20",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as a garment decays."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.11",
      "source_sha256": "9ec29f744334e10b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as one casts off his garment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.12",
      "source_sha256": "6fb623d68dcc627c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that will not happen to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.13",
      "source_sha256": "44bb47881f9aea28",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is the Godhead that said this to the humanity. It is then, therefore, that his enemies will be under his feet, when the prison of hell will be shut upon demons and sinners."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.14",
      "source_sha256": "bdf534a1a0fe5207",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "under the power of his humanity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.15",
      "source_sha256": "9425e7540f77f52d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "since it is the Son of the Godhead who ministered it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.16",
      "source_sha256": "840cc44d34beaa1a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that we may not fall into death like a swift stream."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.17",
      "source_sha256": "5c4cc289850bd3e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that it had to be fulfilled."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.18",
      "source_sha256": "c2c988a410f8be81",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "present death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.19",
      "source_sha256": "9dc65c43f2d90830",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "through miracles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.20",
      "source_sha256": "dd725803a5c5ec42",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "God has confirmed it through the four things."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32c.21",
      "source_sha256": "1e9e1d30099b466b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "under his power"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.1",
      "source_sha256": "a6230dd8bcbd5570",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., while sinners and demons are in transgression"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.2",
      "source_sha256": "280d6c863305fd6d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A gloss on what he said before."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.3",
      "source_sha256": "99b9cc9f099d21d0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That is fitting, after suffering."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.4",
      "source_sha256": "f96a317c688dc9bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it is a small [?] portion; his death was not long-lasting."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.5",
      "source_sha256": "6afca61d858abb1a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., that he should be perfected, i.e., to be exalted from the lowliness of the flesh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.6",
      "source_sha256": "a9c046f7e638f06f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "says the Son, with respect to the flesh"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.7",
      "source_sha256": "3bf09640618faaa2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., who were under my power; he says 'gave' with respect to the flesh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.8",
      "source_sha256": "8fc802ea16a2abcf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Apostle: he is [?] here to the believers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.9",
      "source_sha256": "6deda2adfd8d0417",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "death had been ordained for everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.10",
      "source_sha256": "d84aafe3810d659c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., it is from them that he took flesh, and it is they whom he redeemed, so that he might heal those same ones who are of the same nature."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.11",
      "source_sha256": "251c1a22b06f032f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in works, except in sin only"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.12",
      "source_sha256": "e9469568f2506668",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that their sin might be forgiven them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.13",
      "source_sha256": "b17d685b583b0b45",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., as he has saved himself, he will save everyone who will believe in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.14",
      "source_sha256": "48ced738c0b35ef4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "whom we confess. Moses too was an apostle, since it was by God that he was sent, but they are not alike."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.32d.15",
      "source_sha256": "d1047468ca0511d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he was not treacherous [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.1",
      "source_sha256": "0aa836ee4e73c428",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., by how much"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.2",
      "source_sha256": "348a1913f9abe196",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His, then, is the house, and it is he who built it; but Moses is a man of his household."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.3",
      "source_sha256": "9ae55af006e1ad11",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e., the creatures are the house, i.e., the people."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.4",
      "source_sha256": "f9b5d7c6f4115f2a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Apart from [?] that house, it is God [who built all things]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.5",
      "source_sha256": "8b8090a0eb1f8168",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He was a good man of the household, then, a humble creature [?], but he was not the lord. Otherwise: Moses is a ridge-pole of oak in the house, but it is he [Christ] who built the house, i.e., the faithful of the whole earth, i.e., among the people of Israel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.6",
      "source_sha256": "4f04d9722946cb34",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He is a son in his father's house, and he is lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.7",
      "source_sha256": "b2e6173372b39fe5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "it is we [?] with the righteous"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.8",
      "source_sha256": "816b155ba0f90d87",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "bestowing reward on us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.9",
      "source_sha256": "5e22abb862744328",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that we may meet with our reward"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.10",
      "source_sha256": "f5549437538e5b89",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "contention"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.11",
      "source_sha256": "9f5caadb008cff32",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they desired to know my power, and they had it, too"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.12",
      "source_sha256": "af72e7ec147086c0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. I have encountered them [?], or I have endured them; I was hostile to them, they have opposed me, on account of that generation, i.e. for Israel"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.13",
      "source_sha256": "491bdbf887d8fdf4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. vengeance in anger, or in true judgement"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.14",
      "source_sha256": "b5f9159003ebdfc7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. this is a stronger form of oath than 'non': 'they shall not enter'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.15",
      "source_sha256": "1c7bd96fd29c676e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Beware, you people of the New Testament: for although some good was done for the children of Israel"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.16",
      "source_sha256": "d62d936543046d47",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in the Old Testament"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.17",
      "source_sha256": "94a9cda8b5dce6d5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. as long as it is the New Testament, do every good deed"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.18",
      "source_sha256": "f0ae5686c4c98d3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as long as it is said"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.20",
      "source_sha256": "d792f76e09f455d0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because he was the leader of the expedition"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.21",
      "source_sha256": "7ff3777f42739a76",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a gloss on the 'infensus fui' above"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.22",
      "source_sha256": "d9fb2aae61f3fdb3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that was their burial place"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33a.23",
      "source_sha256": "41e64480c3f47946",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "into the land of promise, or into the new [rest] through faith in the gospel"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.1",
      "source_sha256": "483507c65a68d0ac",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because it was this way with them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.2",
      "source_sha256": "dab9e0b27ddc3f89",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. the land of promise"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.3",
      "source_sha256": "53036c5361a23860",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "they did not have what had been promised to them"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.4",
      "source_sha256": "d5c02aa7f50cd796",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "because their faith was not perfect"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.5",
      "source_sha256": "80f031b28e9b9d69",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Just as there was no entering for them because of their unbelief, there is entering for us through faith; or 'it did not profit', etc., 'just as', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.6",
      "source_sha256": "fffa649c507b7197",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Rest for God after the creation of the elements; rest for the people of Israel in the land of promise; rest for the people of the New Testament in the kingdom of heaven"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.7",
      "source_sha256": "e9fd6509190c56db",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that he uses that word 'rest'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.8",
      "source_sha256": "c620caa17788a438",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Their sins were not forgiven them, but vengeance was brought on them, and they did not enter. You too [?], then, if you sin, it will not be forgiven you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.9",
      "source_sha256": "41fee0814e0b4487",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a different day, a different time, apart from the future eternal rest"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.10",
      "source_sha256": "23f675a476facee5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "after Moses"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.11",
      "source_sha256": "cfdad876a9764db6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "this is the 'aforesaid'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.13",
      "source_sha256": "8eda80919d4a710e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For it would not have been fitting if it had been the true rest that Joshua son of Nun had found."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.14",
      "source_sha256": "744acccfbae15469",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After this rest, then."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.15",
      "source_sha256": "51e58fe3a9ad6d13",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The seventh day, both for them and for us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.16",
      "source_sha256": "8076f7eb9883a3c2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "So that what was said to their companions may not be said to us, i.e. 'if they shall enter', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.17",
      "source_sha256": "804c2ef55927e2c8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The union of the Godhead and the manhood, or the incarnation, the calling, the passion, etc., i.e. from the beginning of the accepted time."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.18",
      "source_sha256": "252f26e042c89c8a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "As far as the difference that is between them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.19",
      "source_sha256": "2e9cef773b68a66f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Soul and spirit are one part and flesh the other; but their division is understood to be the word of God. Otherwise, the division of soul and spirit: the soul itself is the carnal life, but the spirit is the spiritual reason in the soul. The way, then, in which the soul and the grace of God are founded, the word of God knows."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.20",
      "source_sha256": "9b9a4932438da146",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] Let us be alike towards our lord and towards our priest: let us confess our sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33b.21",
      "source_sha256": "51a8e387d37a3c6a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "That he should not be acquainted with our hardships."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.1",
      "source_sha256": "a7a17ffee82d15c9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Men ordain him, or he is chosen from among men."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.2",
      "source_sha256": "013eb0af9b9df91a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Because he is weak like everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.3",
      "source_sha256": "012cc05d642af4ef",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Of the priest: it is not he himself who confers the rank on himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.4",
      "source_sha256": "1df020967b6b8c2b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He is the priest."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.5",
      "source_sha256": "056875ed24e15eb9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It was not his humanity itself that ordained him, but the Godhead."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.6",
      "source_sha256": "405afbfd88bfe63d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Because he was the Son of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.7",
      "source_sha256": "029ab8e40e75b5ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He learned obedience through his sufferings."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.8",
      "source_sha256": "e2fb6590f4c6a81b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In every good deed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.9",
      "source_sha256": "37d5508908bda317",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I.e. this is the condition of the man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.10",
      "source_sha256": "1fdf8296ab10e5a3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Of Melchizedek, of Christ, i.e. his difference from the priests of the Old Testament."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.11",
      "source_sha256": "68beec559e02fa29",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Weak."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.12",
      "source_sha256": "1d297a3ddb345527",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Returning to the Law and deserting grace, i.e. this is what caused it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.13",
      "source_sha256": "b9d33da0730162e5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I.e. the beginning of faith, the alphabet of piety and of faith, i.e. the rudiments [?] of faith, i.e. those which are in the faith."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.14",
      "source_sha256": "66dd7e46b2993777",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This is your condition."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.15",
      "source_sha256": "f3338007ede08ef0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I.e. pottage is proper for you, not food that is strong."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.16",
      "source_sha256": "90a852b35a3e2f7c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is natural for every ignorant person."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.17",
      "source_sha256": "4815215d4b88899f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Solid teaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.18",
      "source_sha256": "4b81a1ca96aeac3a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Good is their understanding; perfect are their senses."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33c.19",
      "source_sha256": "8627d5452307c494",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "To a higher doctrine; you are already learned in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.1",
      "source_sha256": "156ff73a195c1125",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Let faith not be preached [again]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.2",
      "source_sha256": "57c29c01131f7205",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Their undoing [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.3",
      "source_sha256": "e124da42e4f3747e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, the conferring of orders."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.4",
      "source_sha256": "88dbe861548d1b72",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, you are likened to the earth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.5",
      "source_sha256": "e4de7eee9bf21686",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, he will be mindful of the good deeds that you have done."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.6",
      "source_sha256": "4bb960f764bb7e3f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, the brotherly love that you have had."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.7",
      "source_sha256": "30f47806702398a6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "You are still at it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.8",
      "source_sha256": "cf7e0b08badb7de7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "Which has [?] up to now."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.9",
      "source_sha256": "c3e47c722b082f44",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, than himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.10",
      "source_sha256": "b49f86c94895f71b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "When God promised that good thing to Abraham, he swore by himself, because there was no one nobler by whom he could swear."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.11",
      "source_sha256": "eae96659901320b9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That I will bless you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.12",
      "source_sha256": "4fde3942967d7ce7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, certainly a kind of oath, as in 'if they shall enter', etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.33d.13",
      "source_sha256": "20828d759668f73c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "That is, the land of promise, or the kingdom of heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.34a.1",
      "source_sha256": "b10d8730e1741a73",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "His true oath."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.34a.2",
      "source_sha256": "1e9ccb5fb3abc2a5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "For when the anchor is let down, the ship cannot be moved; so also with the mind's intention: every anchor is cast downward, but we cast ours upward."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.34a.3",
      "source_sha256": "ec19e98a5ea9ce8a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "This, then, is evidence about Melchizedek: apart from him, the priests of the gentiles were worshippers of idols."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.34a.4",
      "source_sha256": "58e709b8c5729208",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "[?] each brother after another. That is, it is in this that he is likened to Christ: in the length of time, because the end of his ministry is not described either."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.34a.5",
      "source_sha256": "8451b6739f7a48b7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "How much older he is than Abraham."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/heb#Wb.34a.6",
      "source_sha256": "a2c6ffb704881dc2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 22,
      "text": "It is from their brethren that they receive tithes; it is not the same with Melchizedek."
    }
  ]
}
